\cf0 Gossip
\f1\fs24  is a 
\f0\b push-pull
\f1\b0  exchange: the caller sends its table, the callee merges it and 
\f2\i replies with its own table
\f1\i0 , so the caller can merge that too. One round trip, two-way information flow \'97 this roughly doubles convergence speed for free.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

