\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 In 
\f3\fs26 Put
\f1\fs24 , 
\f3\fs26 Get
\f1\fs24 , and 
\f3\fs26 Delete
\f1\fs24 , add one check right before you'd normally launch a replication RPC to a peer. Example for 
\f3\fs26 Put
\f1\fs24 :\
